    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kevin Beirne Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this CC one acre site for sale with full planning permission for a dwelling house, located in Snugborough, Castlebar, Co. Mayo (F23 PW82).\n\nSituated in the picturesque and peaceful area of Snugborough, this site offers an excellent opportunity to build your ideal home in a sought-after countryside setting. The location provides the perfect blend of rural charm and town convenience, being just a five-minute drive from Castlebar Town Centre and all local amenities.\n\nPositioned just off the Castlebar to Newport Road, this site enjoys easy access to local schools, shops, and recreational facilities, while maintaining the tranquillity of the surrounding countryside.\n\nThis represents a superb opportunity for anyone wishing to construct a family home in a desirable and well-connected location.\n\nP.O.A"
      },
